Cell["\<\
Dropping the far vertex breaks inextensibility, so the truncation is no \
longer a ray.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"612da87c-3cc3-4ac7-bff5-19232363228b"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
